---
subject: "🆕 Novas vagas abertas no turno de {{shiftDate}}!"
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
  <title>Novas Vagas Disponíveis</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; background-color: #0f1117; margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    .email-wrapper { background-color: #0f1117; padding: 40px 20px; min-height: 100vh; }
    .email-container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1f2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0d3b6e 100%); padding: 48px 40px 40px; text-align: center; position: relative; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(99, 179, 237, 0.15); }
    .header::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #60a5fa, #93c5fd, #60a5fa, #3b82f6); }
    .brand-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #60a5fa; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .header-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #f1f5f9; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .header-subtitle { font-size: 15px; color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 400; }
    .body { background-color: #12161f; padding: 40px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .greeting span { color: #60a5fa; }
    .intro-text { font-size: 15px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .info-box { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .info-box-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #3b82f6; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .info-box-text { font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; }
    .slots-highlight { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #f1f5f9; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 4px; }
    .slots-highlight span { color: #60a5fa; }
    .slots-note { font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .cta-text { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .footer { background-color: #0d1117; padding: 28px 40px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
    .footer-brand { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .footer-text { font-size: 12px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-wrapper">
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="header">
        <p class="brand-name">Sistema de Cooperativas</p>
        <h1 class="header-title">Novas Vagas Disponíveis 🆕</h1>
        <p class="header-subtitle">Garanta o seu lugar no turno de {{shiftDate}}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <p class="greeting">Olá, <span>cooperado(a)</span>!</p>
        <p class="intro-text">
          Foram abertas novas vagas em um turno que já conta com membros inscritos. Aproveite a oportunidade!
        </p>
        <p class="slots-highlight"><span>{{newSlots}}</span> nova(s) vaga(s) aberta(s)</p>
        <p class="slots-note">Corra e garanta a sua!</p>
        <div class="info-box">
          <p class="info-box-label">📅 Detalhes do Turno</p>
          <p class="info-box-text">
            <strong>Turno:</strong> {{shiftTitle}}<br>
            <strong>Nova tarefa:</strong> {{taskTitle}}<br>
            <strong>Data:</strong> {{shiftDate}}<br>
            <strong>Horário:</strong> das {{startTime}} às {{endTime}}
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="cta-text">Acesse o portal web para se inscrever!</p>
        <p class="slots-note">As vagas são preenchidas por ordem de chegada.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p class="footer-brand">Sistema de Cooperativas</p>
        <p class="footer-text">Este é um e-mail automático — por favor, não responda diretamente.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>